<title>AUSTRALIA: Millenium consortium wins Sydney stadium tender.</title>
<headline>Millenium consortium wins Sydney stadium tender.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Millennium consortium has been awarded the contract to build a A$280 million multi-purpose stadium for the Sydney 2000 Olympics, Games organisers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The consortium include Abigroup Ltd, Obayashi Corp, Macquarie Bank Ltd and AIDC Ltd.</p>
</text>
